.TH COMMER 1 "August 2026" "Commer" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
commer - simple X11 screen zoom utility

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B commer

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Commer
is a simple X11 application for zooming in on the screen. It provides
keyboard controls for changing the zoom level, mirroring the display,
taking screenshots, and controlling a flashlight overlay.

The application is designed to provide a lightweight and straightforward
way to magnify content on an X11 desktop.

.SH KEYBINDINGS
The following keyboard shortcuts are available:

.TP
.B f
Flashlight.

.TP
.B s
Take a screenshot.

.TP
.B m
Mirror the display.

.TP
.B +
Zoom in.

.TP
.B -
Zoom out.

.TP
.B 0
Reset the zoom level.

.TP
.B l
Lock the flashlight.

.TP
.B q
Quit Commer.

.TP
.B Escape
Quit Commer.

.TP
.B Ctrl
Control the flashlight.

.SH NOTES
.B Commer
requires an X11 environment.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR X (7)

